msgctxt "156"
msgid "Son of a bitch... Let's get outta here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid "Thank you much."
msgstr "Grazie mille."

msgctxt "192"
msgid "Don't mention it."
msgstr "Non c'è di che."

msgctxt "204"
msgid "Oh, I forget to give you autograph. Here, please take."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid "You got Il Yu-Jin's <Color:8>autograph<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid "Wow! That fight was amazing!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid "You're the best, Yu-sama! The best!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid "(I'd better hand over this autograph.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid "(Whew, I made it.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid "Give me your autograph, please."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid "Wait a minute."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid "Is that...? You Kiryu-san, no?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid "(Now that I think about it...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid "Didn't we meet a few years ago?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid ""
"Yes! We meet before, Kiryu-san! You show me around Kamurocho then. It nice "
"to see you again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid "Heh... I could say the same."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid "You come to see me today?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid "You could say that. Why don't we talk over a drink later?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid "That sound good. You take good care of me before."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "420"
msgid "Oh, right. Someone asked me to have you sign this. Would you mind?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "432"
msgid "Sorry. Can't say I recognize you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "444"
msgid "Oh... Maybe I mistake for other guy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "456"
msgid "Anyway, can you sign this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "468"
msgid "Hey!"
msgstr "Ehi!"

msgctxt "492"
msgid "Who are you people?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "504"
msgid ""
"You're Il Yu-Jin, ain't ya? That Korean star who makes shitloads o' money, "
"right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "516"
msgid "What you want from me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "528"
msgid ""
"Lemme tell ya, my boss's wife is a real big fan. Might even be your biggest,"
" pretty boy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "540"
msgid "Oh, that nice..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "552"
msgid ""
"I was thinkin' you could come with us, and we could give her a little "
"private interview right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "564"
msgid ""
"Well, I have big performance to do now... Very sorry, but must be going."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "576"
msgid ""
"Maybe you didn't understand. Or are you tryin' to disrespect us? You're "
"comin' whether you like it or not, hotshot!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "588"
msgid "The man said no."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "600"
msgid "Who the hell is this prick!? Yer fuckin' with the wrong crew, pal!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "624"
msgid "I've met this guy before."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "636"
msgid "Nope, never met this guy."
msgstr ""

